# Keep the Docker build context small and the asset hash reproducible. The
# image only needs pyproject.toml and src/ (see Dockerfile); everything a local
# test run leaves behind would otherwise be hashed into the image asset, so
# running the suite changed the deployed image tag with no source change.
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
*.egg-info
**/*.egg-info
**/.git
**/tests
dist
build
